What will this closure with recursion do?

```dart
Function createFactorial() {
  Function fact;

  fact = (int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return 1;
    return n * fact(n - 1);
  };

  return fact;
}

void main() {
  var factorial = createFactorial();
  print(factorial(5));
}
```

